        "text": "Not sure about \u201cdata wrangling\u201d per se, but Ultorg (fka SIEUFERD) is a very well-developed interface for reshaping / querying relational data by demonstration. <https://people.csail.mit.edu/karger/Papers/sieuferd.pdf|One of its papers> has this nice listing of related systems, including Wrangler, some of which may be relevant to you.",
